index 835cfa3..d901278 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -60,6 +60,16 @@ permissions.
 - Added `promoCodeDetails` field to `CheckoutError`, `OrderError` and `OrderCreateFromCheckoutError`, explaining why a voucher or gift card code was rejected. It returns a `PromoCodeRejectionReason` (e.g. `EXPIRED`, `USAGE_LIMIT_REACHED`, `MIN_SPENT_NOT_REACHED`, `NO_ELIGIBLE_PRODUCTS`) plus `minSpent` / `minCheckoutItemsQuantity` where relevant. It is reported by `checkoutAddPromoCode`, `checkoutComplete`, `orderCreateFromCheckout`, `draftOrderCreate`, `draftOrderUpdate`, `draftOrderComplete` and `Order.errors`.
 - Added `externalReference` support to `Voucher`. Vouchers can now be created with an external reference, looked up using `voucher(externalReference: ...)`, and updated or deleted by external reference instead of ID. The reference can also be changed or cleared through `voucherUpdate`.
 - Added `externalReference` filter to `products(where: ...)`. Supports `eq` and `oneOf`, allowing products to be fetched in batch by their external references.
+- Added age-restricted products: staff flag products with `isAgeRestricted`, customers have a `birthday`, and customers who are guests, have no birthday or are below the store-wide minimum age cannot buy them.
+  - `Product.isAgeRestricted` (set through `productCreate`, `productUpdate`, `productBulkCreate` with `isAgeRestricted`) and the public `Product.ageLabel` (e.g. `18+`). Restricted products stay visible everywhere; the restriction applies to buying only.
+  - Store-wide `Shop.minimumAge` (default `18`, range 1-120) and `Shop.timeZone` (IANA name, default `UTC`), editable with `shopSettingsUpdate` (`MANAGE_SETTINGS`). The shop time zone decides "today" for age checks.
+  - `User.birthday` (nullable date of birth). It can be read only by its owner or by a superuser (first-party token; apps and third-party tokens get `null`), and is never included in webhook payloads, exports, logs or Sentry reports. Set it with `accountUpdate(input: {birthday})` (owner) or the new `customerBirthdayUpdate` mutation (superuser). Birthday-only changes do not trigger `CUSTOMER_UPDATED`.
+  - `User.isAgeEligible` (yes/no for the store-wide minimum age; owner or `MANAGE_USERS`) and `User.canManageBirthday`.
+  - New `CustomerEvent` types `BIRTHDAY_UPDATED`, `BIRTHDAY_VIEWED` and `AGE_ELIGIBILITY_VIEWED`. They are retained (with `CustomerEvent.user` set to `null`) when the actor or the subject user is deleted.
+  - Enforcement: `checkoutCreate`, `checkoutLinesAdd`, `checkoutLinesUpdate` and `checkoutCreateFromOrder` (restricted lines are skipped and reported as `unavailableVariants` with code `AGE_RESTRICTED`) check the buyer; `checkoutComplete` (both payment flows), `orderCreateFromCheckout` and automatic completion re-check under the checkout lock, which is the authority. Errors name the blocking products. Birthday/age related reasons are disclosed only to the checkout owner; other requestors (staff, apps, third-party tokens) get `AGE_RESTRICTED_NOT_ELIGIBLE`. Placed orders are never re-validated.
+  - Draft orders: only the explicit `order.user` link is checked (an order without a customer is allowed). `draftOrderCreate`, `orderLinesCreate`, `orderLineUpdate` (quantity increase) and `draftOrderComplete`/`Order.errors` report `AGE_RESTRICTED_NOT_ELIGIBLE`. `orderBulkCreate` is not checked.
+  - `Checkout.problems` and `CheckoutLine.problems` can contain the new `CheckoutLineProblemAgeRestricted` (`line`, `reason: CheckoutLineProblemAgeRestrictedReasonEnum`).
+  - New error codes `AGE_RESTRICTED_LOGIN_REQUIRED`, `AGE_RESTRICTED_BIRTHDAY_REQUIRED`, `AGE_RESTRICTED_UNDERAGE`, `AGE_RESTRICTED_NOT_ELIGIBLE` (checkout), `AGE_RESTRICTED_NOT_ELIGIBLE` (order) and `AGE_RESTRICTED` (checkout create from order).
 
 ### Webhooks
 
